# ------------------------------------------------------- runtime output ----
# Written next to the executable at runtime, never committed.
sakir.config.json
sakir.log
sakir.log.1

# ------------------------------------------------------ user artwork -------
# Drop your own game backgrounds in here locally; they are yours, not the
# project's, and some of them will be copyrighted game art.
backgrounds/*
!backgrounds/README.md

# ----------------------------------------------------- NEVER COMMIT ---------
# MSI's own binaries. The app loads these from the user's MSI Center install at
# runtime; redistributing them would mean shipping someone else's copyrighted
# code. Listed explicitly so an accidental copy into the tree cannot slip in.
API_Coreliquid.dll
MsiHid.dll
MSIDTOLEDDll.dll
ADLX*.dll
NDA*.dll
CPU_Engine*.dll
DetectFPS.exe
MEG_HMI_Controller.exe
*.winmd

# ------------------------------------------------------------- misc --------
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
